   "text": "MINUTES OF THE BOARD MEETING\nHeld at the offices of Northwind Traders, 45 Harbour Road, Auckland, on 18 April 2024.\n\nPresent: Margaret Chen (Chair), Daniel Okafor (CFO), Sofia Rossi (Secretary), and guest speaker Dr. Ahmed Al-Sayed from the University of Auckland.\n\n1. Apologies were received from Priya Nair, who is travelling in Melbourne this week.\n\n2. The Chair welcomed Dr. Al-Sayed, who presented the findings of the joint research programme with Fonterra. The programme will continue until 31 December 2025, subject to funding approval from Callaghan Innovation.\n\n3. Financial report. Mr. Okafor reported that revenue for the quarter reached NZD 4.2 million. Outstanding invoices from Contoso Pharmaceuticals (Wellington) and Fabrikam Logistics (Sydney) are being chased; contact persons are Laura Bianchi and Tom Nguyen respectively.\n\n4. Personnel. Ms. Rossi confirmed that James Whitaker will join as Head of Operations on 1 June 2024, relocating from Christchurch. His employment contract was reviewed by Russell McVeagh.\n\n5. Any other business. Ms. Chen thanked Daniel Okafor for organising the site visit to the Tauranga warehouse. The next meeting will be held on 23 May 2024 at 10:00 in the Queen Street boardroom.\n\nThe meeting closed at 12:15. Minutes recorded by Sofia Rossi and approved by Margaret Chen.",
